2\", \"fact\": \"Privileged execution of /bin/bash via sudo by user 'ubuntu'.\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T16:20:00+00:00\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"EVT-host-fenn-ubuntu-SUDO-EXEC-62582\", \"fact\": \"Privileged execution of /bin/chmod 777 /var/www/html via sudo by user 'ubuntu'.\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T16:21:00+00:00\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"EVT-host-fenn-ubuntu-SUDO-EXEC-15914\", \"fact\": \"Privileged execution of /bin/bash via sudo by user 'ubuntu'.\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T16:30:00+00:00\"}]",
      "inferences_json": "[{\"statement\": \"External actors utilized automated credential guessing tools against multiple user accounts via SSH.\", \"supporting_evidence_ids\": [\"EVT-host-fenn-ubuntu-AUTH-FAIL-89651\", \"EVT-host-fenn-ubuntu-AUTH-FAIL-40419\", \"EVT-host-fenn-ubuntu-AUTH-FAIL-40972\"], \"rationale\": \"Rapid succession of authentication failures across different accounts and source IPs indicates systematic brute-force activity.\"}, {\"statement\": \"The user 'ubuntu' account was compromised or leveraged by an attacker to escalate privileges and alter system security settings.\", \"supporting_evidence_ids\": [\"EVT-host-fenn-ubuntu-SUDO-EXEC-62572\", \"EVT-host-fenn-ubuntu-SUDO-EXEC-62582\", \"EVT-host-fenn-ubuntu-SUDO-EXEC-15914\"], \"rationale\": \"Execution of root interactive shells and permissive chmod commands via sudo indicates post-compromise activity designed to persist or facilitate further exploitation.\"}]",
      "hypotheses_json": "[{\"statement\": \"The attacker established persistent access by dropping webshells or backdoors into /var/www/html after making it world-writable.\", \"status\": \"unverified\", \"investigation_step\": \"Perform a file integrity check and scan /var/www/html for newly created or modified scripts.\"}]",
